Automated Financial Reporting Workflow — n8n
Builder: Rodrigo Espinosa Quinteros
Type: n8n Automation Workflow
Status: Built and tested (inactive — configurable per client)
Trigger: Monthly scheduled (1st of month, 8:00 AM Guatemala) + Manual
Domain: Financial Reporting, Business Intelligence, SME Operations

Overview
A monthly financial reporting pipeline that reads transaction data from Google Sheets,
calculates core business KPIs in JavaScript, passes the structured data to an AI
financial analyst (GPT-5), and delivers a formatted report simultaneously via email
and Telegram — all without human intervention.
The workflow replaces a manual monthly reporting process. A business owner no longer
needs to open a spreadsheet, calculate margins, and write an interpretation. On the
first of every month at 8:00 AM, a fully analyzed financial report arrives in their
inbox and phone.
Key design philosophy: Separate computation from interpretation. JavaScript handles
the numbers with precision; the AI handles the narrative with context. Neither does
the other's job.

